 or metered is None or metered * 5 >= THRESHOLD_USD * 4:`","Plan: 'carry a degraded/unavailable marker to handler() so the release guard at line 562 still sees signal_unavailable as true' — line 493 CE trigger not mentioned","The comment at 491-492: 'Always take a fresh authoritative read when the meter says we are close; that is exactly the moment a stale CE number is most expensive to trust.'"],"finding":"The plan specifies the degraded partial's effect on the release guard (line 562) and attach path (line 570) but does not state the intended interaction with the CE-poll trigger at line 493 (`metered is None or metered*5 >= THRESHOLD_USD*4`). Converting a degraded partial from None to a float flips `metered is None` to false, which could suppress the fresh authoritative CE read at exactly the moment (partial CloudWatch outage) it is most valuable.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f2fc1bbfdceda0d00","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Resolved design decision section; handler.py line 493","norm_id":"n4411d6cbf6584fac","priority":1.0,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Region 1 healthy contributing spend, region 2 ClientError -> degraded partial float returned -> `metered is None` now false -> CE poll no longer force-triggered by the meter-unavailable branch when not otherwise due"],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"no","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiab